PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 
Prevents Python from writing compiled bytecode files (.pyc) to disk. Reduces unnecessary filesytem writes

PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 
Disables buffering for Python's standard output (stdout) and standard error (stderr).

UV_PYTHON_DOWNLOADS=0 
Prevents uv from automatically downloading Python interpreters. Better for precision of running environment, catches mistakes.

UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT=/opt/venv 
Where to create ana manage project's virtual environment

PATH="/opt/venv/bin:$PATH"<+
This tells Linux to search /opt/venv/bin first when looking for executable commands.
The PATH environment variable contains directories searched for executables